      <div class="pz-still">
        <div class="sr-prose-block sr-prose-block--center">
          <p>After 1945, the Zainichi community faced a choice it had not made and could not avoid: Cold War geopolitics divided the Korean peninsula and forced the diaspora to take sides.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cm-divided-wrap">

